2
00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:32.416
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Food hygiene matters. Saaf haath aur clean utensils food ke saath germs pahunchne ka risk kam karte hain. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:32.416 --> 00:01:04.208
Khaane se pehle sabun aur paani se haath dhona ek simple hygiene habit hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
