Khane se pehle aur baad ke teen safe steps draw karke class poster banao. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

